# CamRadar PiP Assistant

A userscript for **Stripchat, Chaturbate, Bongacams, Cam4 and CamSoda**.

- 🛡 Keep playing when the tab is hidden
- 📺 One-click native Picture-in-Picture
- ⚡ Discover New Models — one click opens the new-models channel of the site you are browsing

## One-click install

Install Tampermonkey, then open:
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/addlenabc/CamNewGirls/main/userscript/camradar-pip-assistant.user.js>

